# Environment configuration for Aqua AI.
# Firebase AI Logic relies on App Check attestation rather than embedded API keys.
# Users who wish to supply their own Gemini, ElevenLabs, or Google Drive API key can configure
# them securely inside the app's Settings / Drive Vault screen (stored via Android Keystore encryption)
# or inject GOOGLE_DRIVE_API_KEY via the AI Studio Secrets panel (.env -> BuildConfig.GOOGLE_DRIVE_API_KEY).
GOOGLE_DRIVE_API_KEY=GOOGLE_DRIVE_API_KEY_DEFAULT_VALUE
